factcheck by anthropic/claude-haiku-5-5: 3 problems
  The reel_script and caption say the 200+ employees protested 'in Coimbatore' (கோவையில்) and the caption says the demand was made on 'நவம்பர் 20ஆம் தேதி'; the article gives 'இன்று (நவ.,20)' which is consistent, so no issue there. However, the article says 'த.வெ.க.-வின் தேர்தல் வாக்குறுதி படி' (TAPS) and the reel_script renders it as 'த வெ க தேர்தல் வாக்குறுதி படி டி ஏ பி எஸ்' with 'TAPS' spelled out as letters, which is an awkward/unclear transliteration rather than a clear Tamil statement, though meaning is preserved.
  The reel_script omits the important fact that the demand for pension scheme was made by the state general secretary as the main point of the protest only partially; more importantly, the reel_script states the monthly pension demand as 'ரூ.6750 அகவிலைப்படியுடன்' without the article's qualifier of 'மாதாந்திர ஓய்வூதியம்' being the amount demanded, and the reel_script says 'மாதாந்திர ஓய்வூதியம் ரூ.6750 அகவிலைப்படியுடன் வழங்க வேண்டும்' which matches; no change needed there.
  The caption says 'நவம்பர் 20, 2026' as the date, which is the posting date and is exempt, but the reel_script says 'நவம்பர் 20ஆம் தேதி' without year, consistent with article.
