factcheck by anthropic/claude-haiku-5-5: 5 problems
  The article says the 15 arrests were made by local police across the listed areas (Puducherry), but the headline and reel/caption frame it as a Mettupalayam story with 15 arrests, and the article's dateline is Puducherry, not Mettupalayam; the draft's location (Mettupalayam) conflates a single Mettupalayam arrest with the 15-person total.
  The reel_script says 'பிற பகுதிகளிலும் போதையில் ரகளை செய்தவர்கள் கைது செய்யப்பட்டனர்' but the article does not say those other arrested people were also brawling in the same way; it only says they were arrested by local police.
  The reel_script states the 15 arrests as all from 'போதையில் ரகளை செய்தவர்கள்' while the article's lead says 15 people were arrested for drunken brawling in public, so the mixing of the Mettupalayam single arrest with the total count is misleading.
  The slides_spec 'போலீசாரின்' slide adds 'பொது இடங்களில் ரகளை செய்தால் கடும் நடவடிக்கை' (warning of strict action), which is an invented claim not in the article.
  The caption's place line for Kirumambakkam is listed as 'கிருமாம்பாக்கம் பகுதியில் 2 பேர்' while the reel and slides omit the Kirumambakkam arrests entirely, so the reel_script misses an important arrest location from the article.
